ent-WeaponLightMachineGunPirateCannon = pirate machine cannon
    .desc = Handheld pirate cannon with belt-fed cannonballs. Straight out of the wildest adventures of Treasure Island. A mix of pirate magic and ingenuity. Do not, under any circumstances, try to figure out how it actually works…

ent-WeaponMachineGunLCG = light chain gun
    .desc = Light machine gun with a high rate of fire and low recoil. Effective for firing on the move and suppressing advancing squads. The high rate of fire and heat reduce accuracy, and prolonged firing increases the chance of jamming.
ent-WeaponMachineGunLCGEmpty = light chain gun
    .desc = { ent-WeaponMachineGunLCG.desc }

